sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend UI<br/>Next.js page
  participant API as API client<br/>apiFetch / carvista-api.ts
  participant MW as Express middleware<br/>auth + validation
  participant RT as Route handler
  participant SVC as Domain or AI service
  participant DB as MySQL via Sequelize
  participant GOV as Official data APIs<br/>FuelEconomy / NHTSA
  participant LLM as Ollama service

  U->>FE: Trigger action<br/>login, save car, request viewing,<br/>compare vehicles, chat with advisor
  FE->>API: Build request payload + JWT
  API->>MW: HTTP request to backend
  MW->>RT: Pass authenticated / validated request

  alt Standard CRUD flow
    RT->>SVC: Call auth / listing / watchlist / request service
    SVC->>DB: Read or write business data
    DB-->>SVC: Rows / mutation result
    SVC-->>RT: Normalized response DTO
  else AI-assisted flow
    RT->>SVC: Call compare / predict / TCO / chat service
    SVC->>DB: Load listings, variants, reviews,<br/>persisted market snapshots
    DB-->>SVC: Structured vehicle + market data
    par Optional official enrichment
      SVC->>GOV: Fetch fuel economy / recall signals
      GOV-->>SVC: Official evidence + source links
    and Optional LLM enhancement
      SVC->>LLM: Generate or refine narrative
      LLM-->>SVC: Natural-language explanation
    end
    SVC-->>RT: AI result + evidence + confidence
  end

  RT-->>API: JSON response
  API-->>FE: Parsed response object
  FE-->>U: Render cards, tables, banners,<br/>charts, recommendations
